[statement]
Observed; the rule is not yet known. A package whose condition holds and
which is a candidate for a name the request requires is not installed
for its condition first: `a` 3, requested with one candidate, is
installed first and completes the condition of `b` 2, yet apk decides
`b` among its candidates and takes `b` 3. With `b` required only later,
through another package, apk takes `b` 3 too; with `b` not required at
all, it installs `b` 2 for its condition.

[repository]
P:b
V:3

P:b
V:2
i:a

P:a
V:3

[request]
b
a

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 3
install b 3
